 "title": "Treasurer | Benton County",
 "text": "-->\nTreasurer | Benton County\ntop of page\nSkip to Main Content\nBENTON COUNTY\nAbout\nWelcome\nCommunity\nDepartments\nContact\nBusiness Info\nMore\nUse tab to navigate through the menu items.\nCounty Government\nAll Departments\nTreasurer\nThe Treasurer responsibilities and duties are as follows: To be the custodian of all money belonging to the county. To collect all money coming into the Treasury.\nThe Treasurer is the investment officer who safeguards the assets while following compliance.\nPlease be aware that the Treasurer’s Office does not calculate bills at all, or makes any decisions on deductions.\nIf you need that type of information, you would need to be in contact with the Auditor’s Office.\nTo print or see your bill, pay your bill or to confirm your payment has processed please log into: lowtaxinfo.com\nTo pay property taxes online, click the button below and use the pay location number 7490. More payment information and options are listed below.\nlowtaxinfo.com\nLOCATION\n706 E 5th Street; Suite 22 Fowler, IN 47944\nBenton County Courthouse\n(2nd Floor)\nHOURS\nMonday - Friday\n8:30 a.m. to 4:00 p.m.\nClosed on major Holidays\nCONTACT\nPH: 765-884-1070\nFax: 765-884-2008\nADDITIONAL LINKS\nAre you interested in learning more about your tax bill, how property taxes are figured or how farmland is assessed? Check out the Purdue Extension Local Government YouTube videos by Larry DeBoer and Tamara Ogle for informative videos on how local government finance works . Watch them here\nLarry DeBoer also writes a column, Capital Comments, which focuses on state and local government policy. To read the column, or subscribe to the podcasts, click here\nADDITIONAL DOCUMENTS\nApplications, Permits, and Zoning\nN/A\nSTAFF\nNiccole McGinnis, Treasurer\nnmcginnis@bentoncounty.in.gov\nKate Daily, Deputy Treasurer\nkate.daily@bentoncounty.in.gov\n765-884-1070 ext 8144\nTOWNSHIP TRUSTEES\nAll Departments\nBENTON COUNTY COURTHOUSE\n706 E 5th Street\nFowler, IN 47944\nHours of Operation\nGENERAL NAVIGATION\nAbout\n​\nContact\n​\nCovid-19 Updates\n​\nEducation / Schools\n​\nGovernment\n​\nHistory\n​\nHome\n​\nJob Openings\n​\nPermits\n​\nUtilities\n​\nVoting Information\n​\nWelcome\n​\nCarbon Sequestration\nCOMMUNITY RESOURCES\nSee Also Community Departments\nADA & Title VI Resources\nLocal Experiences\nBusiness Directory\nEvents\n​\nHealth Department\n​\nLibraries\n​\nVeterans Affairs\nDEPARTMENTS\nAdministration\nAssessor​\nAuditor​\n​\nCentral Committees\n​\nCounty Clerk​\n​\nCommissioners​\n​\nCounty Council​\n​\nRecorder​\n​\nTreasurer\nCommunity\n​\nADA & Title VI Resources\nChamber of Commerce\n​\nBe In Benton\n​\nCooperative Extension Service ​\n​\nEconomic Development Department\n​\nBenton County Tourism\n​\nFamily & Children Division\n​\nRetirement Village\n​\nVeterans Affairs\nDEPARTMENTS\nHealth & Safety\n​\nDispatch - 911\n​\nEmergency Medical Services (EMS​)\n​\nHealth Department\n​\nHomeland Security &\nEmergency Mgt.​\n​\nSheriff's Department\n& Jail\nInfrastructure\n​\nAdvisory Plan\nCommission\nBuilding Inspector​\n​\nHighway Department\n​\nSoil / Water Conservation\n​\nSurveyor\nJustice\nCircuit Court\nProbation\nProsecuting Attorney\nOUR COMMUNITIES\nTown of Ambia\n​\nTown of Boswell\n​\nTown of Earl Park\n​\nTown of Fowler\n​\nTown of Otterbein\n​\nTown of Oxford\nHELPFUL LINKS\nSmart911 SignUp & LogIn\n​\nGIS Mapping: For property aerial maps, parcel assessment, and tax info.\n​\n2021 Indiana Municipal Guide\n​\nGuide to Securing your Home\n​\nVoter Information\n​\nIndiana Voter Portal\n​\nIndiana Office of Energy Development\n​\n2018 Benton County Comprehensive Plan\n​\nBest Colleges in Indiana 2022\n2025 Benton County Indiana All Rights Reserved\nWebmaster: Signature Web Creations\nbottom of page",
